    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my monstera deliciosa has been looking kinda rough lately. a few of the lower leaves are turning this weird sickly yellow color. i'm in seattle so it's pretty cloudy and dark here most of the time. is this probably too much water or am i just not giving it enough nutrients?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
